# Product docs handoff

`docs/ROADMAP.md` and `docs/PROGRESS.md` were removed. Do **not** recreate a multi-phase roadmap unless the user explicitly asks.

## Required reading (session start)

1. [docs/USER_GUIDE.en.md](docs/USER_GUIDE.en.md) / [docs/USER_GUIDE.zh.md](docs/USER_GUIDE.zh.md) — user-facing behavior
2. Recent git status / the user’s request — current task scope

## Scope discipline

- Implement only what the user asked for in this session.
- Challenge remains a **simplified** solo engine (not a full CR / Arena opponent).
- AI stays optional (BYO key); do not make features unusable without a key.
- Prefer finishing the asked slice over expanding into adjacent pillars.

## Required writes (session end, if user-visible behavior changed)

1. Update `docs/USER_GUIDE.zh.md` / `docs/USER_GUIDE.en.md` when behavior users see changed.
2. Update README feature blurbs when positioning or major surfaces change.

## UI stability

New features must not collapse existing arena UI style, layout, or interactions. Prefer engine/docs fixes; UI changes should be minimal increments that reuse existing components.
